Name: OPUS-MT Spanish-English
Short Name: opus-mt-es-en
URL: https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-es-en
Version: Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-es-en revision c96e2c5399ebfae4fc43d9669556b9afa74bb69d (Tatoeba-Challenge spa-eng, opus-2020-08-18)
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
The University of Helsinki's OPUS-MT model (Language Technology Research
Group) translates Spanish captions into English on the device in Tark for
Android's live captions; Hindi and Tamil follow through IndicTrans2.
Tark uses the checkpoint's weights, SentencePiece model and vocabulary.

Local Modifications:
Rebuilt in plain PyTorch and exported to ONNX (an encoder and a cached
decoder step) with per-channel int8 weights by utils/marian_export.py; the
pad token is never chosen (the checkpoint's bad_words_ids). No change to the
model's behaviour beyond int8 rounding.
